{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-06_end","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-06","title":"捲入洪流","storyCode":"11-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"cdb20adca407da65b8a4d94d1a03e9e7eb8fe90e642976d0a78dda198464aa20","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"薩卡茲對城內的控制突然收緊。與此同時，一隊薩卡茲雇傭兵進入工廠，準備秘密處決凱瑟琳等補給線資訊的知情人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g2_dukegarden"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才你都瞧見了嗎，摩根？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幾個倉庫守衛緊張得團團轉，結果什麼都沒看清，就被老子兩下放倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，這點炸肉乾拿去，今天算你贏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，就知道你不服氣。下次換你跟我一起去啊達格達，讓輸的人放哨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們在盯著我們看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看什..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...你有什麼事嗎？沒什麼事的話讓開，我忙著去廚房弄點喝的，幹了這麼多活兒，渴死老子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天你們不該那樣做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指我們冒險引開薩卡茲的巡邏隊，讓你們的人從倉庫裡順利脫身嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我是不是聽錯了？你們該說的是謝謝才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩迪恩區的戰友們很感激你們，我們也是。這趟任務完成得很順利。但是為什麼要燒掉那倉庫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倉庫不是薩卡茲的，是普通維多利亞商人的！它現在只是被薩卡茲占了而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，這幫有錢人，心有多貪，膽就有多小。他們樂意幫薩卡茲，我就樂意讓他們多吃點虧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道，你們這種行為是在逼他們更快投向薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那更好。等這些人成了叛徒，下次見面老子燒的就不再是他們的倉庫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是自救軍的做法，而是流氓的作派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊莎貝爾小姐，您還執意要與她們一起行動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡，我叫達格達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的沒想到，伊莎......達格達小姐。阿勒黛小姐在給我們介紹您與那位殿下的身份的時候，我們本以為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......推進之王第一天就告訴過你們，與自救軍一起行動的是格拉斯哥幫，而不是亞歷山德莉娜殿下與塔樓騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可難道您想看著一個混混領導我們，甚至坐上王座嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你*維多利亞粗口*憑什麼這麼說維娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，別亮刀，這可是在別人家裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多戰士都寧願追隨您還有坎伯蘭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住口！不，我是說，請不要再說下去了。只要我們還站在一起，你就不該說這樣的話來傷害同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我失言。我向你們道歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該攔著我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不攔著你，維娜就要頭疼了，還有羅德島的小兔子和博士。下次你再衝動，記得多想想自己是跟誰一塊來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......真沒想到有天你會反過來說我衝動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"環境在變，我總得適應的。你看達格達，不是適應得挺好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你別誇我，不習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當我想誇你？跟你過一樣的日子，我難受得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是摩根，這幾天我算是明白了一個道理，我們不適應的話，遲早跟不上維娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，肉乾給你，今天算我倆誰都沒贏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拿著吧，我沒胃口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜，這幾天我一直在想......這樣的日子，就一定是維娜想過的嗎？自從她來了這裡，那些貴族和商人什麼時候給過她應有的尊重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你錯了，摩根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們遲早會發現維娜是一位好領袖，而且這份尊重不是什麼應得不應得的，一定是維娜自己贏來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_manorindoor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，阿勒黛小姐，你終於來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，最近在忙些瑣事，總是脫不開身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你一度要給那套蒸汽甲胄找買家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您的消息可真靈通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"只是些傳言罷了，我聽一位做生意的朋友說，最近可能有一套蒸汽甲胄會從倫蒂尼姆流出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"不過最後關頭，交易取消了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，那麼寶貝的物件，您可不能隨意出手啊，眼下的行情可賣不出高價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您的建議，家裡僅剩的那點產業總還要想辦法運轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，理解，我們手頭上那點小錢，對薩卡茲來說有什麼意義呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宴會還沒開始嗎？你們不用等我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼行，這些年，您可是中央區我們這些倒楣蛋的主心骨！我們能活著撐到今天，還多虧了您的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不敢去找那幫瘋子談條件，他們甚至連錢都不收！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說笑了，伯爵大人，我並沒有任何榮譽的身份，只是出於對各位高貴的閣下如今處境的不平，仗義執言了幾次罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，還說這些幹嘛？坎伯蘭家一定會在您的手中重新發揚光大的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，那些事情都是些陳年舊事啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"等到倫蒂尼姆重新安穩下來——啊，我也沒有說現在倫蒂尼姆不安穩的意思啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，坎伯蘭家在未來一定會得到我們的感謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"萊托中校到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族＆精明的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向您致敬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"萊托中校，您可真是操勞，最近我們的宴會，好久沒有請動您的大駕啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"您一定是在為了我們的和平奔走吧！我們由衷感謝您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"剛好，我最近有位朋友，弄到了幾瓶好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"要是以前，我可實在拿不出手，不過如今的情況下，已經算稀罕啦，改天我就送到您的府上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......女士們，先生們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自今天起，不會再有宴會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後，各位都會接受軍事委員會的審查，祝各位好運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市儈的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"不，等等！您這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"萊托中校，萊托中校！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛小姐，您可一定得幫我們再去找萊托中校聊聊！他這種玩笑可不能隨便亂開，我......唉！這是要死人的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"萊托中校，您等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲之前一直在拖延時間，他們放任這些腦滿腸肥的廢物繼續歌舞昇平，無非是不想給大公爵們一個團結起來的藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪一位大公爵不想當維多利亞的主人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞貴族網路的中心就是倫蒂尼姆，得罪了倫蒂尼姆的貴族就是冒犯整個國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種對維多利亞的冒犯，會讓大公爵們不得不放下對彼此間利益的盤算，進軍倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而如今，薩卡茲們不在乎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想做的事已經做到了。艾爾希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的人認為倫蒂尼姆過去的幾年是災難，而如今——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭真的來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，那我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能不能和那幾位貴族大人說的一樣，去找萊托中校談談？也許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們喊我“主心骨”。可艾爾希，在薩卡茲掌控倫蒂尼姆之前，剛才的哪位先生小姐曾踏足坎伯蘭府？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大公爵那些真正的朋友，又何時參與過這些裝模作樣的宴會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是那些籌碼不夠，或是明哲保身的貴族推出來的招牌而已，他們以坎伯蘭的名號團結起來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，成為目標的，就只會是坎伯蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，艾爾希。通知自救軍和羅德島的朋友們，馬上撤離公爵府，那裡已經不安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後去看一看吧......那座屬於我們祖先的莊園。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族？","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族？","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"這是公爵給你的信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"剛在奧克特里格區待了沒幾天，又到海布里區來了。看看這些工廠和密密麻麻的樓房，我就沒見過比這更憋人的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，等我們做完這趟任務，是不是又能回中央區了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"就算回去了，你又能幹什麼？曼弗雷德那傢伙，到底是怎麼把你這種沒怎麼殺過人的小孩都招來倫蒂尼姆的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是小孩子了！格林還在的時候，我們在哥倫比亞一起做過很多工的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"老格林......呵，他把自己的命丟在了薩迪恩區，害得我來替他當保姆。我還不如早點剁了他的腦袋換賞金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......你們不是朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒有義務教你怎麼當雇傭兵，小孩。好好完成你的任務，看著點地圖。接下來往哪裡走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十一號軍工廠，就在前面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德將軍給的名單還挺長......這些都是知道點什麼的老工人，對吧？只要把他們帶到沒人看到的地方幹掉就行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，還不如把整個工廠的人都殺光算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼為了生產線照常運作，要求我們“精準地把那些知情者封口，不要濫殺”......嘁，淨給我們找麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰讓他是雇主嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"行了。收好名單，趕緊走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g4_ordnancefactory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一年多沒見了，我可真想你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我該早點想辦法聯絡大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說這種客套話，見到你我可高興壞了。這一年裡我跟所有人說，你會活著回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧那邊的通風口。還記得吧？沿著管道爬出去，外邊有一小塊平台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好幾年前，你跟我們打賭說，你要從那裡跳出去，跳到隔壁廠房的屋頂上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都嚇壞了。那平台有足足幾十米高！摔下去不就完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你還是跳了。我們之中一開始只有你敢跳，後來......哈哈，後來湯米跳了，戴跳了，最後我也跳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次他們問我，你會不會已經死了，我都會叫他們抬頭瞧瞧那通風口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......那時候我們還真是什麼都不怕，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以這就是你在自救軍的朋友嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特，你這個朋友看起來就很有學問啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，自救軍裡什麼人都有，看來真是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士確實是個很有學問的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我是自救軍的合作夥伴。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還有合作夥伴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來越來越像回事了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你這次回來是做什麼的，有沒有我能幫上忙的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱、"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱瑟琳......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，凱瑟琳，既然費斯特回來了，他是不是就不用走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先別急著幫他說話。至於你，還有你的朋友，我們再換個地方說話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特，你別怪凱瑟琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不在的這一年，都是凱瑟琳和那些薩卡茲周旋，我們廠才能做到一個人都沒少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一次差點就出事了，她甚至鬧到了城防軍的領袖過來調解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，最近，薩卡茲們催得越來越緊了，凱瑟琳也很難做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道，帕特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼可能怪奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我加入自救軍，當我真正瞭解到我將面對什麼後，我才真正理解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶當時做出的決定，有多困難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，說吧，這次回來是做什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是來找東西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，薩卡茲有一條隱藏的補給線，以此支撐著他們的瘋狂戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而補給線的終點，我們現在確定，就在這片工業區中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要找到那條補給線。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"費斯特說，您最瞭解這片工業區。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶你是最瞭解這片工業區的人，我想，你肯定知道一些線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我才想要來找你幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誇我也沒有任何好處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們只需要一些線索。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我們不會給工廠添任何麻煩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼覺得，我會幫你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定，我剛才已經讓帕特去找那些薩卡茲雇傭兵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是這樣......那我也只能和其他人一起逃跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你們四天前在薩迪恩區鬧出來的那番動靜，死了多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都記得他們的名字嗎？你記得他們的臉嗎？你記得他們每一個人死前是什麼表情，說的最後一句話又是什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先別回答，費斯特。別臨時想一個答案來糊弄我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道這位“博士”是怎麼想的，但我瞭解你。你覺得自己很聰明，而小聰明並不總能騙過死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱瑟琳！不好了，門口出現了很多薩卡茲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們馬上離開這裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說，城防軍的長官，萊托中校要見你，他們是來接你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬治，看好這兩個外人，別讓他們亂走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g4_ordnancefactory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抽煙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"別跟我套交情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊托長官要見我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們廠最近應該按時完成了指標，沒有什麼值得長官操心的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"少廢話了，長官要見你，跟我們來就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我一下，我還有些事要處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"老東西，不要搞錯了，你沒有選擇權。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太突然了，我總要交代一下工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等她一下也沒有關係吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）將軍的意思也是不要把事情做得太明顯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖，你只有十分鐘時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足夠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，他們找你要幹什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，趕緊跟上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
